    "text": "Mid-Hudson News Network\nwebsite\nHartsdale\nCouple and nanny charged with brutal kidnapping and assault\nBy Mid-Hudson News Staff,\n1 days agoWHITE PLAINS – A married Hartsdale couple and their nanny were indicted and arrested in connection with the kidnapping and assault of a 19-year-old Queens woman. Wayne Barnes, 44, was charged with kidnapping, criminal possession of a weapon, and five counts of assault. He was released on $300,000 bond.\n1",
